  "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/755\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/755</a></p><p>에</p><p>초간단 학습지 검사법(1)을&#160;소개하였습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이번에는</p><p>이렇게 매시간 검사한 학습지 모음을</p><p>정기적으로 한학기에 두 번 정도</p><p>자기평가를 하는 방법을 소개합니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 학습지 1쪽에 나의 학습&amp;학습지에서 잘한 점 3가지 작성하기</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 86.6825%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 42.7136%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83a1150b00bdf1dc8e42262570e1dda06341750a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"300\" height=\"355\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83a1150b00bdf1dc8e42262570e1dda06341750a\" data-origin-width=\"218\" data-origin-height=\"258\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 43.9698%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/57d413a0306ad7414fc8eea95ae5f305f95de9e0\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"300\" height=\"342\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/57d413a0306ad7414fc8eea95ae5f305f95de9e0\" data-origin-width=\"233\" data-origin-height=\"266\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>2. 나의 학습지 중에서 &#39;선생님, 꼭 봐주세요&#39; 부분에 별 2개 표시하기</p><p>&#160;</p><p>3. 교사는 학습지를 검사하면 해당 부분에 공감되면</p><p>&#160; &#39;참 잘했어요!&#39; 인증도장 찍어주기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/33b93102c35794d15edceef675a6c3274af3174a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"290\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/33b93102c35794d15edceef675a6c3274af3174a\" data-origin-width=\"1544\" data-origin-height=\"747\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8cf9c48e61acc4aeca1c88e033424f31958f8bb0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8cf9c48e61acc4aeca1c88e033424f31958f8bb0\" data-origin-width=\"666\" data-origin-height=\"187\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>&#160;4. 검사한 학습지를 나눠주고 &#39;자기평가&#39; 설문지를 작성하기&#160;</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa86b2720ef50cf0f6dd579e08557c373554f6be\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" height=\"668\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa86b2720ef50cf0f6dd579e08557c373554f6be\" data-origin-width=\"721\" data-origin-height=\"741\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>5.<span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b> &#39;자기평가&#39;</b></span> 설문 내용을 세특 작성에 참고하기&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}